<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN SYNERGIA MAKES SLOW EURO.NM START.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN SYNERGIA MAKES SLOW EURO.NM START.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Synergia NV made a slow debut on Monday to trading on Brussels' Euro.NM market, ending the day at 640 Belgian francs, 10 francs below its issue price, with just 1,252 shares traded.</p>
<p>Synergia sold 645,000 shares, or 49.81 percent of its issued capital, in an initial public offering which closed last Friday. Around 215,000 shares were sold to private investors.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
